  "fullContentHtml": "<h2>IRDAI Assistant Manager AM Phase-I Score Card 2024 - Complete Details</h2>\n<p>Insurance Regulatory and Development Authority of India (IRDAI) Are Recently Uploaded Phase-I Score Card for the Post of Assistant Manger (Various Stream) Recruitment 2024 (1376 Post). All Registered Candidates Can Download Phase-I Score Card Now in the Given Link Below..</p>\n<h3>Important Dates</h3><ul>\n<li>Online Apply Start On: 21 August 2024</li>\n<li>Registration Last Date : 20 September 2024</li>\n<li>Last Date for Fee Payment : 20 September 2024</li>\n<li>Admit Card Available : 23 October 2024</li>\n<li>Tier-I Exam Date : 06 November 2024</li>\n<li>Tier-I Result : 26 November 2024</li>\n<li>Tier-I Marks : 23 December 2024</li>\n<li>Tier-II Admit Card: 11 December 2024</li>\n<li>Tier-II Exam Date : 21 December 2024</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Application Fee</h3><ul>\n<li>General / OBC/ EWS Candidates : Rs.750/-</li>\n<li>SC / ST / PwDB Candidates : Rs. 100/-</li>\n<li>Payment Mode: Pay the Examination Fee Through Debit Card / Credit Card / UPI / Net Banking Fee Mode.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Important Links</h3><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://ibpsonline.ibps.in/irdaijun24/scdax1_dec24/login.php?appid=f8d3588a24f66b50b1cf988ddaabc067\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Download Phase-I Score Card</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.resultbharat.com/NOTICE/IRDAI-AM-Phase-II-Result-2024.pdf\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Download Notice for Phase-I Score Card</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://ibpsonline.ibps.in/irdaijun24/oecl_dec24/login.php?appid=5a0b944b3564cc05e50a0fe71b9455ff\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Download Phase-II Admit Card</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.resultbharat.com/NOTICE/06.11.2024%20%E0%A4%95%E0%A5%8B%20%E0%A4%86%E0%A4%AF%E0%A5%8B%E0%A4%9C%E0%A4%BF%E0%A4%A4%20%E0%A4%9A%E0%A4%B0%E0%A4%A3-%20I%20%E0%A4%91%E0%A4%A8%E0%A4%B2%E0%A4%BE%E0%A4%87%E0%A4%A8%20%E0%A4%AA%E0%A4%B0%E0%A5%80%E0%A4%95%E0%A5%8D%E0%A4%B7%E0%A4%BE%20%E0%A4%95%E0%A5%87%20%E0%A4%AA%E0%A4%B0%E0%A4%B